          gameplay: 'Players place a legal tile to a matching open end of the shared layout. Dice effects, if used, are applied by the table profile to constrain choices or modify scoring without changing the base rule that a placed tile must match an open end. Blocked turns resolve by drawing or passing as defined by the table profile.',
