            'A tile placement must match the value of an open end.',
            'Dice effects modify the profile layer, not the tile matching legality.',
            'Blocked-turn handling and scoring depend on table profile.',
          ],
          hasPlaceholders: false,
        },
        strategy: {
          basic: 'Maintain mobility with flexible tiles and avoid being trapped with high-pip exposure.',
          intermediate: 'Treat dice as a risk signal; keep options open so profile constraints do not strand your hand.',
          advanced: 'Use end control to shape the board into states that are favorable under the dice-driven profile incentives.',
          tips: [
            'Avoid narrow dependencies on a single value when dice can shift constraints abruptly.',
            'Duplicate tiles reduce certainty; plan robustly rather than relying on unique-tile inference.',
          ],
